# Space repeat is swallowed both while pending and while Meta is held.
0 in key KEY_SPACE down
200 in key KEY_SPACE repeat
300 in key KEY_SPACE up
300 out key KEY_SPACE down
300 out key KEY_SPACE up
400 in key KEY_SPACE down
600 in key KEY_A down
600 out key KEY_LEFTMETA down
600 out key KEY_A down
650 in key KEY_SPACE repeat
700 in key KEY_A up
700 out key KEY_A up
700 out key KEY_LEFTMETA up
750 in key KEY_SPACE up
